    old "Fumo Court: Shiki Eiki's Logic Trials is a free, non-commercial fan game.\n\nTouhou Project and all of its characters belong to Team Shanghai Alice (ZUN). This game is an unofficial fan work. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or produced by Team Shanghai Alice. Please support the official games.\n\nThe character sprites are photographs of the official Fumo plushies by Gift. Their backgrounds were removed with the open BiRefNet segmentation model and they were relit to match the courtroom. The sparks, fire and smoke in the fight are from Kenney's Particle Pack (CC0). Everything else is hand-written vector code: plain SVG shapes and Ren'Py styles. Nothing in the game is AI-generated art.\n\nSound effects by Warsong, from the Petaldust and Nostalgiac Blues sound packs (CC0). The fight also uses CC0 sounds from OpenGameArt by qubodup and rubberduck.\n\nMusic by +TEK, arrangements of ZUN's compositions, used under CC BY 4.0 (creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0). Each was cut to loop seamlessly, loudness-normalised and re-encoded. Title: \"Scarlet Beyond a Crimson Dream\", from Embodiment of Frequency Modulation. Cirno's theme: \"Beloved Tomboyish Girl\" (おてんば恋娘), from Story of Modulated Frequency. Marisa's theme: \"Love-coloured Master Spark\" (恋色マスタースパーク), from Embodiment of Frequency Modulation. Sakuya's theme: \"Lunar Clock ~ Luna Dial\" (月時計 ～ ルナ・ダイアル), from Embodiment of Frequency Modulation. Reisen's theme: \"Lunatic Eyes ~ Invisible Full Moon\" (狂気の瞳), from Embodiment of Frequency Modulation. Case 05 and Mokou: \"Reach for the Moon, Immortal Smoke\" (月まで届け、不死の煙), from Embodiment of Frequency Modulation. Meiling's theme: \"Shanghai Teahouse ~ Chinese Tea\" (上海紅茶館 ～ Chinese Tea), from Story of Modulated Frequency. Alice's theme: \"The Doll Maker of Bucuresti\" (ブクレシュティの人形師), from Phantasmagoria of F.M. Reimu's theme: \"Maiden's Capriccio ~ Dream Battle\" (少女綺想曲 ～ Dream Battle), from Phantasmagoria of F.M. Kaguya's theme: \"Gensokyo Millenium ~ History of the Moon\" (千年幻想郷 ～ History of the Moon), from Story of Modulated Frequency. Aya's theme: \"Because Princess Inada Is Scolding Me\" (稲田姫様に叱られるから), from Phantasmagoria of F.M. Pursuits, Cases 01 to 11: \"U.N. Owen Was Her S\", \"Bad Apple!!\", \"Flowering Night\", \"Pierrot of the Star-Spangled Banner\", \"Heian Alien\", \"Nostalgic Blood of the East ~ Old World\", \"Doll Judgment ~ the Girl Who Played with People's Shapes\", \"Native Faith\", \"Reverse Ideology\", \"Captain Murasa\" and \"Joutounin of Ceramics\", from Embodiment of Frequency Modulation, Story of Modulated Frequency and Phantasmagoria of F.M.\n\nText is set in Shippori Mincho B1 by FONTDASU and Noto Serif SC by Google, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (see game/fonts/).\n\nBuilt with Ren'Py."
    new "Fumo Court: Shiki Eiki's Logic Trials（布偶法庭：四季映姬的逻辑审判）是一款免费、非商业的同人游戏。\n\n东方Project及其所有角色归上海爱丽丝幻乐团（ZUN）所有。本作是非官方同人作品，与上海爱丽丝幻乐团无关，未获其认可，也非其制作。请支持官方作品。\n\n角色立绘是Gift公司官方Fumo布偶的照片，背景由开源的BiRefNet分割模型去除，并按法庭场景重新打光。战斗中的火花、火焰和烟雾来自Kenney的Particle Pack（CC0）。其余一切都是手写的矢量代码：SVG图形和Ren'Py样式。游戏中没有任何AI生成的美术。\n\n音效：Warsong的Petaldust与Nostalgiac Blues音效包（CC0）。战斗还使用了OpenGameArt上qubodup与rubberduck的CC0音效。\n\n音乐：+TEK对ZUN作品的编曲，以CC BY 4.0（creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0）授权使用。每首都剪辑为无缝循环，统一了响度并重新编码。标题：“Scarlet Beyond a Crimson Dream”（Embodiment of Frequency Modulation）。琪露诺的主题：“Beloved Tomboyish Girl”（おてんば恋娘，Story of Modulated Frequency）。魔理沙的主题：“Love-coloured Master Spark”（恋色マスタースパーク，Embodiment of Frequency Modulation）。咲夜的主题：“Lunar Clock ~ Luna Dial”（月時計 ～ ルナ・ダイアル，Embodiment of Frequency Modulation）。铃仙的主题：“Lunatic Eyes ~ Invisible Full Moon”（狂気の瞳，Embodiment of Frequency Modulation）。第五案与妹红：“Reach for the Moon, Immortal Smoke”（月まで届け、不死の煙，Embodiment of Frequency Modulation）。美铃的主题：“Shanghai Teahouse ~ Chinese Tea”（上海紅茶館 ～ Chinese Tea，Story of Modulated Frequency）。爱丽丝的主题：“The Doll Maker of Bucuresti”（ブクレシュティの人形師，Phantasmagoria of F.M）。灵梦的主题：“Maiden's Capriccio ~ Dream Battle”（少女綺想曲 ～ Dream Battle，Phantasmagoria of F.M）。辉夜的主题：“Gensokyo Millenium ~ History of the Moon”（千年幻想郷 ～ History of the Moon，Story of Modulated Frequency）。文的主题：“Because Princess Inada Is Scolding Me”（稲田姫様に叱られるから，Phantasmagoria of F.M）。追击（第一案至第十一案）：“U.N. Owen Was Her S”“Bad Apple!!”“Flowering Night”“Pierrot of the Star-Spangled Banner”“Heian Alien”“Nostalgic Blood of the East ~ Old World”“Doll Judgment ~ the Girl Who Played with People's Shapes”“Native Faith”“Reverse Ideology”“Captain Murasa”“Joutounin of Ceramics”（Embodiment of Frequency Modulation、Story of Modulated Frequency、Phantasmagoria of F.M）。\n\n字体：FONTDASU的Shippori Mincho B1，Google的Noto Serif SC，SIL Open Font License 1.1（game/fonts/OFL.txt）。\n\n使用Ren'Py制作。"

